  "title": {
    "zh": "溶解与饱和",
    "en": "Dissolution & Saturation"
  },
  "desc": {
    "zh": "一勺勺往水里加盐，开始全化掉，加到某个点再也不化——这个「装满」的状态叫饱和，它不是不动了，而是溶解和结晶一样快。",
    "en": "Add salt to water spoon by spoon: at first it all disappears, then at some point it will not dissolve any more. That “full” state is saturation — not frozen, but dissolving and crystallising at the same speed."
  },
